{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">新華社報道，甘肅省定西市一個景區發生山洪，至少10人遇難。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發的景區位於定西市渭源縣，下午出現落暴雨引發山洪，部分露營遊客被困，導致死傷，當地公安、消防趕抵達現場展開救援。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.FLOOD-2000_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026aZ7wknhaGU1785066673.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.FLOOD-2000_001.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.FLOOD-2000_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026DPKCnmhn2I1785066684.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.FLOOD-2000_002.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-26T12:57:54.828972+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}